OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and wet today across
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland, southern Scotland
OL,7,Fand northern England, although rain
OL,8,Feasing a little later. Bright spells
OL,9,Fwith a few showers for northern
OL,10,FScotland, otherwise dry and very warm
OL,11,Fwith plenty of sunshine elsewhere.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain will continue to move
OL,14,Fsouthwards across northern England,
OL,15,Fbut weakening as it does so. Clear
OL,16,Fspells either side, but with a few
OL,17,Fshowers across Scotland and Northern
OL,18,FIreland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
