OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloud and a few spots of rain
OL,6,Fin central areas will clear
OL,7,Fsouthwards, leaving a largely dry day
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells. Feeling slightly
OL,9,Fcooler, but still warm in the south.
